{
  "uid": "entry-normal",
  "title": "入口 · 正常",
  "description": "開発の環境で、いつもの量と時間を、サービスをまたいで並べる入口（core#111。つながり・呼び出しの行は core#110・#109・#108 で足す）",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "tags": [
    "diecardomain",
    "entry"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "ダッシュボード",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "diecardomain"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "サービス",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "core,core-db,studio,game",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "core|core-db|studio|game",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "環境",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "development,test",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "development",
          "value": "development"
        },
        "options": [],
        "description": "開発の環境（development）とテスト用の環境（test。make test）のどちらを見るか（core#120）。ハートビートと受け手（Collector）の欄は、この選択によらない"
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "届いている",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "state-timeline",
      "title": "ハートビート",
      "description": "決まった間隔で必ず届く信号が、直近 3 分に届いているか。途切れたら、そのサービスが止まっているか、受け手に届いていない。core は指標（60 秒ごと）、studio・game は healthcheck のリクエストのスパン、core-db は受け手が読んでいるログのファイル。動かしていないサービスは途切れたと出る 開発の環境の分だけを見る（テスト用の環境が同じサービス名で送っても、届いているにならない。core#120）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "途切れた",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "届いている",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showValue": "never",
        "mergeValues": true,
        "rowHeight": 0.8,
        "legend": {
          "showLegend": false
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(count_over_time(target_info{job=\"core\", deployment_environment_name=\"development\"}[3m])) > bool 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "core"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(otelcol_fileconsumer_open_files) > bool 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "core-db"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"studio\", deployment_environment_name=\"development\"}[3m])) > bool 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "studio"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"game\", deployment_environment_name=\"development\"}[3m])) > bool 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "game"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "ログの届いた数",
      "description": "サービスごとに Loki に届いたログの数。操作したのに伸びなければ、届いていない。core は操作が無いと出さず、core-db は遅い SQL・誤りのときだけ出す",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service_name) (count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\"}[$__auto]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "スパンの届いた数",
      "description": "サービスごとに Tempo に届いたスパンの数（Tempo が数えた traces_spanmetrics_calls_total）。core-db はスパンを出さない",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 7,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "fillOpacity": 80,
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "sum"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (service) (increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{deployment_environment_name=~\"$env\", service=~\"$service\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
